  "question": {
    "text": "The minimum distance between the curves <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is",
